      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For a small group of people who have this issue, here how to roll back to old version. This is the only way I can get online on VRChat with my friends other than not playing VRChat at all.\n\n- Press Windows key + R\n\n- Type in \"steam://nav/console\" (without quote) Steam will pop up with a hidden console\n\n- Type in \"download_depot 438100 438101 8008128395415543089 : download a single depot\" (without quote)\n\n- After it said finished downloading, go to <path of your steam library>/steamapps\\content\\app_438100\\depot_438101 Then you can double-click on start_protected_game.exe to get into VRChat with old version.\n\nVRC dev might be against it, but just wait for them to fix the client. Be patient",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
